---
// Redrawn diagram of the telescopic arm's gain-scheduled feedforward controller.
---
<figure class="gs reveal">
  <div class="gs__grid">
    <!-- (a) arm model -->
    <svg class="gs__arm" viewBox="0 0 360 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="gs-arm-t">
      <title id="gs-arm-t">Arm model: the arm pivots at angle theta above horizontal and extends a distance D; its center of mass moves outward as D grows, so the gravity torque about the pivot depends on both theta and D.</title>
      <defs>
        <marker id="gs-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#ffffff" /></marker>
        <marker id="gs-p" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#b57bff" /></marker>
        <marker id="gs-t" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#5eead4" /></marker>
        <pattern id="gs-grid" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M20 0H0V20" fill="none" stroke="rgba(176,140,255,.1)" /></pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="360" height="300" fill="url(#gs-grid)" />
      <!-- ground reference -->
      <line x1="40" y1="250" x2="340" y2="250" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.25)" stroke-dasharray="4 6" />
      <!-- arm at 35 degrees: stages drawn as nested tubes -->
      <g transform="translate(60 250) rotate(-35)">
        <rect x="0" y="-11" width="130" height="22" rx="3" fill="#2d2346" stroke="#8f76c9" />
        <rect x="100" y="-8" width="95" height="16" rx="3" fill="#3a2d5c" stroke="#9f86da" />
        <rect x="170" y="-6" width="70" height="12" rx="2" fill="#4a3a75" stroke="#b39cf0" />
        <rect x="222" y="-4" width="58" height="8" rx="2" fill="#5c4892" stroke="#c7b3ff" />
        <!-- extension D -->
        <line x1="130" y1="26" x2="280" y2="26" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="1.5" marker-start="url(#gs-t)" marker-end="url(#gs-t)" />
        <text x="205" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="gs__lbl" fill="#5eead4">D (extension)</text>
        <!-- center of mass -->
        <circle cx="150" cy="0" r="7" fill="#fff" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="3" />
      </g>
      <!-- pivot -->
      <circle cx="60" cy="250" r="12" fill="#0d0a15" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" />
      <circle cx="60" cy="250" r="3" fill="#fff" />
      <!-- theta arc -->
      <path d="M130,250 A70,70 0 0 0 117.3,209.9" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.6)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="138" y="232" class="gs__lbl" fill="#fff">θ</text>
      <!-- gravity at CoM: cm at 150 along arm => (60+150cos35, 250-150sin35) = (182.9, 164) -->
      <line x1="182.9" y1="164" x2="182.9" y2="232" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#gs-a)" />
      <text x="190" y="214" class="gs__lbl" fill="#fff">Mg</text>
      <text x="196" y="150" class="gs__lbl" fill="#c79bff">x<tspan font-size="10" dy="3">cm</tspan><tspan dy="-3">(D)</tspan></text>
      <!-- torque arrow around pivot -->
      <path d="M36,236 A28,28 0 1 1 42,272" fill="none" stroke="#b57bff" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#gs-p)" />
      <text x="16" y="222" class="gs__lbl" fill="#b57bff">τ</text>
    </svg>

    <!-- (b) controller -->
    <div class="gs__flow" role="img" aria-labelledby="gs-flow-t">
      <span id="gs-flow-t" class="sr-only">Controller block diagram: the pivot absolute encoder gives theta and the extension motor encoder gives D. A gain schedule computes the feedforward torque alpha times D times g times cos theta for the pivot and m g sin theta for the extension. That feedforward is added to a PID correction on the position error and sent to the motors.</span>
      <div class="gs__col">
        <div class="gs__node gs__node--in"><b>Pivot absolute encoder</b><span>θ (arm angle)</span></div>
        <div class="gs__node gs__node--in"><b>Extension motor encoder</b><span>D (extension)</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gs__arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="gs__node gs__node--core">
        <b>Gain schedule</b>
        <span>center of mass &amp; inertia as a function of D</span>
        <code>τ<sub>ff,pivot</sub> = α·D·g·cos θ</code>
        <code>F<sub>ff,ext</sub> = m·g·sin θ</code>
      </div>
      <div class="gs__arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="gs__col">
        <div class="gs__node gs__node--sum"><b>Σ</b><span>feedforward + PID correction on position error</span></div>
        <div class="gs__node gs__node--out"><b>Pivot &amp; extension motors</b><span>steady at any angle and length</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Redrawn gain-scheduling feedforward: the controller predicts the gravity load for the current angle and extension, so the PID loop only has to correct small errors.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gs { margin: 32px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: linear-gradient(160deg, #150f24, #0b0812); }
  .gs__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 22px; align-items: center; }
  .gs__arm { width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #0a0711; }
  .gs__lbl { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .gs__flow { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .gs__col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  .gs__node { display: grid; gap: 3px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-2); }
  .gs__node b { font-family: var(--font-display); color: #fff; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .gs__node--core { background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.35), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12)); border-color: rgba(199, 155, 255, 0.55); }
  .gs__node--core code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.84rem; color: #fff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 4px; width: fit-content; }
  .gs__node--sum b { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--accent-2); }
  .gs__node--out { border-color: rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.45); }
  .gs__arrow { height: 22px; position: relative; }
  .gs__arrow::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 6px; width: 2px; background: var(--accent); }
  .gs__arrow::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: calc(50% - 5px); bottom: 0; border: 6px solid transparent; border-top-color: var(--accent); border-bottom: 0; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .gs__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .gs__col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
